settings.battery_guide_content:
Android systems (especially Samsung and OEM ROMs) restrict idle background apps to save battery.

To ensure timely alerts when locked:
1. Tap 'Go to Settings' below;
2. In 'Battery', select 'Unrestricted' instead of 'Optimized';
3. If available, allow 'Alarms & reminders' and 'Auto-start'.

